     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem eu-ai-clinical-validation-status-cs</b></p><a name=\"eu-ai-clinical-validation-status-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hceu-ai-clinical-validation-status-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://example.org/fhir/eu-ai-transparency/CodeSystem/eu-ai-clinical-validation-status-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">clinically-validated<a name=\"eu-ai-clinical-validation-status-cs-clinically-validated\"> </a></td><td>Clinically Validated</td><td>Clinical validation for the documented intended use has been completed.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">not-clinically-validated<a name=\"eu-ai-clinical-validation-status-cs-not-clinically-validated\"> </a></td><td>Not Clinically Validated</td><td>Clinical validation for the documented intended use has not been completed.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">validation-in-progress<a name=\"eu-ai-clinical-validation-status-cs-validation-in-progress\"> </a></td><td>Validation In Progress</td><td>Clinical validation is ongoing and no final validation conclusion has yet been documented.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">technical-validation-only<a name=\"eu-ai-clinical-validation-status-cs-technical-validation-only\"> </a></td><td>Technical Validation Only</td><td>Technical verification or validation has been performed, but clinical validation for the intended use has not been completed.</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
